			"notes": "# Note this is a beta release so expect bugs, if you find one please report it on our discord server and add [Beta] to the title\n> There may be an issue with the update notifier, ignore it\n\n## What's Changed\n* Updating the mod-base to 1.20.4 by @maghedo243 in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/340\n* Deleted oldSrc by @maghedo243 in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/341\n* More 1.20 Codebase by @maghedo243 in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/342\n* updates block state argument serializer by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/343\n* Updates sending commands on keybind by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/344\n* removes weird import leftover from mappings updater by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/345\n* removes all weird imports left over by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/346\n* updates all utils by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/347\n* Deleted random ununsed imports and fixed all the LiteralText errors by @maghedo243 in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/348\n* fixes some ui stuff by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/349\n* fixes mixins and player.sendChatMessage by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/350\n* rewrite by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/351\n* Fixed all the GUI errors by @maghedo243 in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/352\n* rewrite by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/353\n* rewrite by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/356\n* Serializer Changes to Arguments by @maghedo243 in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/357\n* rewrite by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/358\n* rewrite by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/359\n* rewrite by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/361\n* Ported macro GUI by @MiranCZ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/362\n* adds javaassist by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/364\n* Use AutoService by @xtrm-en in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/365\n* don't crash lol by @xtrm-en in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/366\n* fixes mod version by @RUGMJ in https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/pull/367\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/RedstoneTools/redstonetools-mod/compare/v1.18.2-2.0.0...v1.20.4-beta"
